{"id":437,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Some believe that its bell-like cry opens holes to another world. It has been revered as a deity since ancient times."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Many scientists suspect that this Pokémon originated outside the Galar region, based on the patterns on its body."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Some believe it to be a deity that summons rain clouds. When angered, it lets out a warning cry that rings out like the tolling of a bell."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Ancient people believed that petitioning Bronzong for rain was the way to make crops grow."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It brought rains by opening portals to another world. It was revered as a bringer of plentiful harvests."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It can summon rain clouds. People long ago revered it as the bringer of plentiful harvests."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"One caused a news sensation when it was dug up at a construction site after a 2,000-year sleep."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."},{"name":"Heatproof","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's heatproof body halves the damage taken from Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Heavy Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":436,"name":"Bronzor","condition":null,"children":[{"id":437,"name":"Bronzong","condition":"Lv. 33","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,335],[1,33],[1,93],[1,109],[1,241],[1,311],[1,371],[12,286],[16,360],[20,95],[24,219],[28,326],[32,484],[38,334